meta {
  name: 8 Record consent
  type: http
  seq: 8
}
put {
  url: {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/providers/{{providerEmail}}/consent
  body: json
}
body:json {
  {
    "acceptedTerms": true,
    "acceptedPrivacy": true
  }
}
docs {
  Acceptance of the Terms and Conditions and the Privacy Policy, recorded as two timestamps on the profile
  (`termsAcceptedAt`, `privacyAcceptedAt`). Byte-identical contract to
  `2-Customer/9 Record consent` — see that request for the full reasoning.

  ⚠️ **Two booleans, not two dates: the server stamps the time.** ⚠️ **Both flags are always written, so
  `false` clears a previous acceptance** rather than leaving it standing.

  Answers `200`, `403` for another provider's email, `404` when no provider has that email.
}
